Brainstorming Ideation
Brainstorming & Ideation Phase

Problem Identified:
Creating an interesting comic story and developing characters can be difficult and time-consuming, especially for beginners.

Idea:
Build an AI-powered comic story creator using the Google Gemini API that helps users create comic stories, characters, dialogues, and creative story ideas.

Why This Idea:

- Combines AI-powered story creation, character generation, and dialogue writing in one app.
- Uses generative AI to create creative and personalized comic content.
- Makes comic creation easier and faster for beginners.
- Simple enough to build and demonstrate within the project timeline.

Project Name Chosen:
ComicCraft-AI – Gemini Powered Comic Story Creator
